[16.358446, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Scope\r\u001b[7d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_What this platform will and will not do._\r\u001b[9d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mDevelopment of infrastructure as code using OpenTofu and Bicep.\r\u001b[10d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mLocal emulation and validation workflows (Moto, Docker, GitHub Actions).\r\u001b[11d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mEndpoint hardening and security baseline definitions for rural branch workstations.\r\u001b[12d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mThreat modeling (v0 to v3) targeting offline sync, data tampering, and endpoint theft.\r\u001b[13d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mLocal AI feature modeling (e.g., credit fraud detection / anomaly detection).\r\u001b[14d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m100% text-native evidence logging (asciinema session casts, scanner output files, pipeline logs).\r\u001b[16d"]
[16.358931, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Success criteria\r\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_How we will know the platform is good enough._\r\u001b[19d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mObjective 1 (Zero-Cost Code-Defined Architecture): Model and deploy an AWS-pattern cloud backend using OpenTofu again\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[20;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mObjective 2 (Endpoint & Edge Security): Define declarative device configuration and encryption baselines for remote b\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[21;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mObjective 3 (Automated Pipeline Gates): Implement GitHub Actions workflows that automatically detect and block unencr\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[22;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mObjective 4 (Measured Disaster Recovery): Prove measured Recovery Time Objectives (RTO) and Recovery Point Objectives\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[23;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mObjective 5 (Defensible Compliance): Present an end-to-end e-portfolio where every architecture and security decision\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[25;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Assumptions\r\u001b[26d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_What we are taking as given._\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
