[41.833618, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m# Project Charter — \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36m<Persona name>\r\u001b[4d\u001b[32m_Complete this in Phase 1._\r\u001b[6d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Scope\r\u001b[7d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_What this platform will and will not do._\r\u001b[9d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mDevelopment of infrastructure as code using OpenTofu and Bicep.\r\u001b[10d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mLocal emulation and validation workflows (Moto, Docker, GitHub A\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[11;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mEndpoint hardening and security baseline definitions for rural b\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[12;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mThreat modeling (v0 to v3) targeting offline sync, data tamperin\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[13;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mLocal AI feature modeling (e.g., credit fraud detection / anomal\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[14;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m100% text-native evidence logging (asciinema session casts, scan\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[16;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Success criteria\r\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_How we will know the platform is good enough._\r\u001b[19d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mObjective 1 (Zero-Cost Code-Defined Architecture): Model and dep\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[20;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mObjective 2 (Endpoint & Edge Security): Define declarative devic\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[21;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mObjective 3 (Automated Pipeline Gates): Implement GitHub Actions\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[22;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mObjective 4 (Measured Disaster Recovery): Prove measured Recover\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[23;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mObjective 5 (Defensible Compliance): Present an end-to-end e-por\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[25;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Assumptions\r\u001b[26d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_What we are taking as given._\r\u001b[29d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^G\u001b(B\u001b[m Help\u001b[14G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^O\u001b(B\u001b[m Write Out \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^W\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Is  \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^K\u001b(B\u001b[m Cut\u001b[53G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^T\u001b(B\u001b[m Execute\r\u001b[30d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^X\u001b(B\u001b[m Exit\u001b[14G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^R\u001b(B\u001b[m Read File \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^\\\u001b(B\u001b[m Replace   \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^U\u001b(B\u001b[m Paste     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^J\u001b(B\u001b[m Justify\u001b[?25l\r\u001b[28d\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[2d\u001b[?25l"]
